	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02r0701_GIRL2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>３ばんどうろの　そだてやさん▼
ときどき　ポケモンの　タマゴが
みつかるって　ウワサの　ウワサ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T10:13:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>３番道路の　育て屋さん▼
ときどき　ポケモンの　タマゴが
みつかるって　ウワサの　ウワサ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T09:19:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T10:10:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02r0701_dancer_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でんこうけいじばん　みてる？▼
たいりょうはっせいした　ポケモンの
ニュースが　いま　あついんだダヨ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>電光掲示板　みてる？▼
大量発生した　ポケモンの
ニュースが　いま　熱いんだダヨ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:16:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanで新規作成
　元はr13r0201にいた動作モデル</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T09:18:02" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DANCER</Text>
